<title>USA: Jacor to buy three radio stations.</title>
<headline>Jacor to buy three radio stations.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jacor Communications Inc said Thursday it agreed to buy the assets of three radio stations serving Lexington, Kentucky.</p>
<p>The purchase of WTKT-AM, WKQQ-FM and WXZZ-FM remains subject to regulatory approval, Jacor said.</p>
<p>Jacor owns, operates or provides programming for 104 radio stations and one television station.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
